Error [E0969]: An `imports:` directive must be `find("<dir>")`
  --> env.jet:3:14
    |
  3 |     imports: gather("./modules")
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: Imports auto-discover a directory of modules (U4); discovery uses `find` with one string-literal path, while recognized first-party integrations use their typed calls
 Fix: Write `imports: find("./modules")`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0969
